{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳になった次の日から、急に大人っぽくなる気がしてならない北野日奈子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！96回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\n棚からよもぎ餅さんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/07/4108657/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は雨風が強くて、\n傘をさすのをやめようか迷いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、この雨にうたれて\n風に吹かれたら\n今の気持ち全部どこか行くんじゃないかな～って思ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと、やってみようって思ったけど\nやめたよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やめようと思った理由もちゃんとある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうだ！今日は\n月刊エンタメさんに取材してもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんとひなちまと日奈子で！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売は4月30日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、ひめちゃんと蘭世と\n撮影があるよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また報告します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/07/4108657/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/07/4108657/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップがだいすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真の角度で耳がないように見えて\nアザラシみたいでかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あゝめんこい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/07/4108657/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/07/4108657/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  航平さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きぃちゃんおはよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎いつもコメントありがとう！\nこんばんは！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はあまりついてない日でした。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなことやこんなことがありました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く明日にならないかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  ひろとさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎悩んでるって事は成長してる証拠やで‼︎\nこれからも頑張ってね-_-b"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そうですね～。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、周りのみんなはもうその悩み事から脱出して新しいステージにあがってて\nキラキラしてるのに\n私はまだ悩み事が解消してなくて\nモヤモヤ～です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  あゆあゆさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんの好きな飲み物は？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎炭酸飲料全部！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛乳！コーヒー牛乳！いちごみるく！\n最近は、カフェオレ？カフェラテ？\nもすき！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スターなコーヒー屋さんに行く時は、\n抹茶フラッペ飲む！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(407)  マスオさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎自分も今仕事が終わって\n疲れた～♪(^◇^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎お疲れ様です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/07/4108657/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/07/4108657/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ